{
  "tema": 6311,
  "slug": "alguien-pronombre",
  "titulo": "Alguien: someone, anyone",
  "subtitulo": "¿Hay alguien en casa?",
  "foto": "t09.jpg",
  "regla": "Alguien means someone, and anyone in questions. It is only for people, never changes form and takes a singular verb. As an object it needs the personal a: Busco a alguien. In negative sentences use nadie.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Alguien** = _someone, somebody_. In questions it also means _anyone, anybody_: ¿Hay **alguien** aquí?"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Only for **people**. It **never changes**, and the verb is **singular**: **Alguien** llamó."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "When it's the object of the verb, it takes the **personal a**: Veo **a alguien**. ¿Conoces **a alguien** en Ensenada?"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "An adjective after it is **masculine singular**: **alguien especial**, **alguien nuevo**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "In a **negative** sentence, _anyone_ is **nadie**: _I don't see anyone_ = **No veo a nadie**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **algo** is a thing, **alguien** is a person. The extra **-ien** has a face."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "==Alguien== tocó la puerta.",
              "en": "Someone knocked on the door."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Hay ==alguien== en casa?",
              "en": "Is anyone home?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Te busca ==alguien== en la recepción.",
              "en": "Someone's looking for you at the front desk."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Conoces a ==alguien== en Ensenada?",
              "en": "Do you know anyone in Ensenada?"
            },
            {
              "es": "==Alguien== dejó la llave del agua abierta.",
              "en": "Someone left the tap running."
            },
            {
              "es": "Vi a ==alguien== en la playa con tu tabla.",
              "en": "I saw someone at the beach with your board."
            },
            {
              "es": "Necesito hablar con ==alguien== de la oficina.",
              "en": "I need to talk to someone from the office."
            },
            {
              "es": "Quiero conocer a ==alguien== especial.",
              "en": "I want to meet someone special."
